000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TRPTEXDT.
000400 AUTHOR.         KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   JULY 24, 1981.
000600*REMARKS.
000700*
000800*D    THIS PROGRAM PRODUCES A REPORT SHOWING ALL PURCHASE ORDERS
000900*D    THAT WERE DUE FOR RECEIPT ON A GIVEN DELIVERY DATE BUT
001000*D    EITHER WERE NOT RECEIVED OR ONLY PARTIALLY RECEIVED.
001100*D    THIS REPORT SHOWS ONLY POs PAST DUE ON ONE SPECIFIED DATE.
001200*D    THIS REPORT IS ON BOTH THE PURCHASING AND MATERIALS CONTROL
001300*D    MENUS
001400*D
001500*D    RSCREEN REPORT NUMBER:  18
001600*D    REPORT HEADER FILE:  DHDR18.PUB
      *C
      *C  06/22/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 5733
      *C      1. ADDED LOGIC TO SELECT PO'S BY BUYER CODE.
      *C      2. CHANGED SCREEN FRPTEXDT/ZRSCREEN TO ALLOW INPUT
      *C         OF SELECTED BUYER CODE.
      *C
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  SEPTEMBER 1996  J E COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR COMPLIANCE WITH THE YEAR 2000.
      *C
      *C  OCTOBER 28, 1997  CA YODER  REQ #97-013
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO RESTRICT REPORT BY VENDOR CODE.  UP TO
      *C   THREE VENDOR CODES CAN BE SPECIFIED.
      *C
      *C  11/05/97        CA YODER
      *C   CORRECTED Y2K LOGIC PER Y2K TESTING.
      *C
      *C  03/02/99        CA YODER
      *C   ADDED CHECK TO VERIFY THAT LOW-DATE AND HIGH-DATE ARE
      *C   NUMERIC.  PROGRAM WAS BLOWING UP IF THESE TWO FIELDS WERE
      *C   BLANK.
      *C
      *C  02/20/02        BE GEISER
      *C   CHANGE ITEM COMPLETE FLAG CHECK TO LOOK FOR NON SPACES.
      *C
