038700 BEGIN-PROC.
038800     PERFORM  1-HSK  THRU  1-HSK-X.
038900     PERFORM  6-MAIN  THRU  6-MAIN-X.
039000     PERFORM  2-CLOSE-FILES  THRU  2-CLOSE-FILES-X.
039100
