039500 1-HSK.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.

039600     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
039700     MOVE CHAR-1636PI  TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
039800     MOVE CHAR-10PI    TO NORMAL-PRINT.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR DPORECD DPOITEM DRCVITEM MSTORERM
                      MBUYER.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 3
               IF VENDOR-CODES (SUB) > SPACES
                   IF VEND-8-10 (SUB) = SPACES
                       MOVE "000"    TO  VEND-8-10 (SUB)
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
           IF LOW-DATE NOT NUMERIC     MOVE 0 TO LOW-DATE.
           IF HIGH-DATE NOT NUMERIC    MOVE 0 TO HIGH-DATE.
