           IF YY OF TODAYS-DATE > "70"
               MOVE "19"                 TO CC
           ELSE
           MOVE "20"                     TO CC.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE-CN           TO SAVE-TODAYS-DATE,
                                            GREG-DATE.
